>
	<p>
		I'm Bolarinwa — a full-stack engineer with six years across the whole stack: React and
		TypeScript on the front, Go services and infrastructure behind. That range runs across fintech,
		crypto/web3, and developer tooling — most recently the payments and identity surfaces businesses
		use to move real money.
	</p>

	<p>
		Give me a problem and I'll take it from ambiguity to production, and follow through after it
		ships. I like finding the leverage that makes a whole team ship faster, sweating developer
		experience, and building AI-natively — and when something's unusually rough, I'll probably fix
		it so the next person has it easier.
	</p>

	<p>
		Here I write about engineering, web3, and how building software is changing in the agentic era.
		You'll find my code (some of it open source) on <a href="https://github.com/RinwaOwuogba">GitHub</a>,
		and me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bolarinwa-owuogba">LinkedIn</a>.
